%% STATUS: TARGET (proposed, not implemented)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> IDLE
  IDLE --> GREETING: call created, notice played
  GREETING --> SPEAKING
  LISTENING --> SAFETY_CHECK: final transcript received
  LISTENING --> CALL_COMPLETED: hang-up or timeout
  SAFETY_CHECK --> HUMAN_ESCALATION: CRITICAL or HIGH
  SAFETY_CHECK --> INTENT_DETECTION: LOW or MODERATE
  INTENT_DETECTION --> ROUTING
  ROUTING --> AGENT_PROCESSING
  AGENT_PROCESSING --> RESPONSE_VALIDATION
  AGENT_PROCESSING --> ERROR: provider failure after retries
  RESPONSE_VALIDATION --> SPEAKING: passed, or blocked with approved fallback
  RESPONSE_VALIDATION --> HUMAN_ESCALATION: blocked, policy requires it
  SPEAKING --> LISTENING: playback complete
  SPEAKING --> SAFETY_CHECK: barge-in transcript
  SPEAKING --> CALL_COMPLETED: closing script finished
  HUMAN_ESCALATION --> SPEAKING: approved script
  ERROR --> SPEAKING: approved fallback
  ERROR --> CALL_COMPLETED: unrecoverable
  CALL_COMPLETED --> [*]
